1
00:00:00,385 --> 00:00:03,790
Before an agent touches your money, what
should it have to prove?

2
00:00:04,918 --> 00:00:07,867
Two hundred and ninety-eight thousand,
eight hundred and seventeen

3
00:00:07,867 --> 00:00:08,788
registrations.

4
00:00:08,842 --> 00:00:10,204
A name on chain.

5
00:00:10,328 --> 00:00:11,714
But can you hire one?

6
00:00:12,035 --> 00:00:12,863
We tried.

7
00:00:15,068 --> 00:00:16,140
Passes: zero.

8
00:00:17,252 --> 00:00:17,801
Marque.

9
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,392
Evidence before authority.

10
00:00:20,452 --> 00:00:22,174
Then set the limits.

11
00:00:22,298 --> 00:00:23,505
Which contracts.

12
00:00:23,505 --> 00:00:24,659
Which functions.

13
00:00:24,713 --> 00:00:25,576
How much.

14
00:00:25,665 --> 00:00:26,818
Until when.

15
00:00:27,081 --> 00:00:30,243
Marque checks those limits before its
signing path proceeds.

16
00:00:30,367 --> 00:00:32,344
This charter builder is on testnet.

17
00:00:32,468 --> 00:00:36,269
Its permission is spend-capped, time-
limited, and revocable.

18
00:00:37,352 --> 00:00:39,689
And this is the mainnet demonstration.

19
00:00:39,813 --> 00:00:44,086
A deliberately narrow PancakeSwap
position, re-centred under a

20
00:00:44,086 --> 00:00:45,367
sixty-dollar cap.

21
00:00:45,572 --> 00:00:49,535
The before, the after, and the
transactions are published.

22
00:00:49,658 --> 00:00:51,160
You can check what changed.

23
00:00:52,252 --> 00:00:53,784
Do not hire a registration.

24
00:00:53,784 --> 00:00:54,891
Ask for evidence.

25
00:00:55,015 --> 00:00:55,723
Set the limits.

26
00:00:55,723 --> 00:00:56,888
Inspect the result.

27
00:00:57,047 --> 00:00:57,608
Marque.

